Package: amplitude
Version: @VERSION@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: libc6, libx11-6
Recommends: zenity | kdialog, libdbus-1-3
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Homepage: https://amplitude.cr.rs
Description: Lightweight audio player
 Amplitude is a lightweight audio player for your own files, with a tiny
 executable and memory footprint. It plays MP3, FLAC, WAV, Ogg Vorbis,
 Opus, AAC/M4A and tracker modules (MOD, XM, S3M, IT), and loads
 classic .wsz skins.
